<title>USA: Tribune Co Q1 net off.</title>
<headline>Tribune Co Q1 net off.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.49		    $1.09</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.45		     1.00</p>
<p> Net		 64,505		   139,696</p>
<p> Revs		593,919		  537,122</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  122,546		  123,432</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 net includes income from discontinued operations of $89.3 million; primary EPS include income from discontinued operations of $0.72 a share; fully diluted EPS include income from discontinued operations of $0.66 a share.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 net, primary EPS and fully diluted EPS excluding income from discontinued operations were, respectively, $50.4 million, $0.37 and $0.34.</p>
<p>In March 1996, the company sold its holdings in QUNO Corp as part of QUNO's merger with Donohue Inc. QUNO accounted for as discontinued operation in financial statements.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 was December 30, 1996, to March 30, 1997.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 was January 1, 1996, to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
